      {
        "section_number": "7.3.4",
        "title": "Support and Application of TLS",
        "content_preview": "\n[V2G2-630] Support of TLS is mandatory for the EVCC for all Identification Modes except for Identification Mode \"EIM\" with Message Set EIM charging AC and Message Set EIM charging DC, in both cases excluding Message Set VAS as defined in subclause 8.6. \n\n[V2G2-631] Support of TLS is mandatory for the SECC for all Identification Modes except for Identification Mode \"EIM\" in a Trusted Environment with Message Set EIM charging AC and Message Set EIM charging DC, in both cases excluding Message Set...",
