        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "7.6.3.2",
        "title": "Stateless auto address configuration (SLAAC)",
        "content_preview": "\n[V2G2-050] Each V2G Entity shall support the configuration of a link-local IPv6 unicast address as specified in IETF RFC 4291. \n\n[V2G2-051] The interface ID of the Link-Local address of a V2G Entity shall be generated from its IEEE 48 bit MAC identifier according to the definition in IETF RFC 4291. \n\n[V2G2-052] The EVCC shall support auto configuration of IP6 addresses as described in IETF RFC 4862. \n\n[V2G2-053] If the SECC provides the Message Sets Certificate Install, Certificate Update, or V...",
        "content_length": 618,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
