      },
      {
        "section_number": "7.6.3.3",
        "title": "Address selection",
        "content_preview": "\n[V2G2-054] If multiple IPv6 addresses are supported, the IPv6 Default Address Selection shall be performed according IETF RFC 3484. \n",
