        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "7.8.3.2",
        "title": "Header Processing",
        "content_preview": "\nFor the processing of the payload the V2GTP entity has to process the header first. For this, a V2GTP entity that receives a V2GTP message checks the header field step by step. The header processing as defined below is illustrated in Figure 10. \n\n[V2G2-089] A V2GTP entity shall process the V2GTP header as defined in Table 9 before processing the payload as defined in Table 10. \n\n[V2G2-090] A V2GTP entity shall check the protocol version and inverse protocol version fields (synchronization patte...",
