        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "7.9.2.3",
        "title": "Contract Certificates as XML signature credentials",
        "content_preview": "\nContract Certificate is bound to a EMAID and used in XML signature to authorize the vehicle for charging. The Contract Certificate can be verified even if the SECC is offline. The contract binding is handled as follows: \n\n[V2G2-108] The EMAID shall be encoded in the subject of the certificate. \n",
        "content_length": 297,
        "level": 1,
