        "section_number": "8.3.3",
        "title": "Message Header Definition",
        "content_preview": "\nThe message header contains general information that is included in all messages. Figure 20 shows the schema definition of the V2G message header. \n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-03-18/ef87c0e3-acd6-46d4-bc33-443a4314ecab/7795f56d06086a532e81d6fb3f8196343640d66d6dce25992e715a6f05ed3057.jpg)\n\n\n\nFigure 20 — Schema Diagram – Message header\n\n\n[V2G2-181] The message elements of the message header shall be used as defined in Table 24. \n\n\nTable 24 — Semantics and type definit...",
        "content_length": 1543,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
