      {
        "section_number": "8.3.4",
        "title": "Message Body Definition",
        "content_preview": "\nThe message body contains information details related to a specific message. Figure 21 shows the schema--``, definition of the V2G message body. The messages described in the following clause are derived from BodyBaseType, which represents the abstract message content (refer to subclause 8.3.2). The different application messages are defined by the BodyElement and described in detail in subclause 0. \n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-03-18/ef87c0e3-acd6-46d4-bc33-443a4314...",
        "content_length": 1128,
        "level": 1,
