      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.2.1",
        "title": "SessionSetupReq",
        "content_preview": "\nBy using the SessionSetupReq message the EVCC establishes a V2G Communication Session. \n\n[V2G2-188] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in subclause 8.6.2, the EVCC and the SECC shall implement the mandatory messages and message elements as defined Table 104 and according to Figure 23. \n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-03-18/ef87c0e3-acd6-46d4-bc33-443a4314ecab/c764644963bc23b885f5f30a66ce249828efeae3778250e3ffb286f2b6a88448.jpg)\n\n\n\nFigure 23 — Schema Dia...",
        "content_length": 1188,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [
          "V2G2-189",
          "V2G2-188",
          "V2G2-879"
        ],
        "is_message_def": false,
