          },
          {
            "parameter": "th",
            "value": "6",
            "unit": "s",
            "type": "timer",
            "section": "8.4.3.2.1"
          }
        ],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.2.2",
        "title": "SessionSetupRes",
        "content_preview": "\nBy using the SessionSetupRes the SECC responds to a SessionSetupReq. With the SessionSetupRes the SECC notifies the EVCC with an enclosed ResponseCode, whether establishing a new session or joining a previous Communication Session was successful or not. \n\n[V2G2-190] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in subclause 8.6.2, the EVCC and the SECC shall implement the mandatory messages and message elements as defined in Table 104 and according to Figure 24. \n\n![image](https://cdn-min...",
        "content_length": 2162,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [
          "V2G2-191",
          "V2G2-190",
          "V2G2-192"
        ],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [
          {
            "parameter": "th",
            "value": "7",
            "unit": "s",
            "type": "timer",
