        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.4.1",
        "title": "ServiceDetailReq",
        "content_preview": "\nBy sending the ServiceDetailReq message the EVCC requests the SECC to send specific additional information about services offered by the EVSE. \n\n[V2G2-197] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in subclause 8.6.2, the EVCC and the SECC shall implement the mandatory messages and message elements as defined in Table 104 and according to Figure 27. \n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-03-18/ef87c0e3-acd6-46d4-bc33-443a4314ecab/51a32f9699d9c1cfd29e2f85f5e6bc39ed8e...",
        "content_length": 1048,
