        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [
          "V2G2-197",
          "V2G2-198"
        ],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.4.2",
        "title": "ServiceDetailRes",
        "content_preview": "\nAfter receiving the ServiceDetailReq message of an EVCC the SECC sends the ServiceDetailRes message and provides details about services. \n\n[V2G2-199] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in subclause 8.6.2, the EVCC and the SECC shall implement the mandatory messages and message elements as defined in Table 104 and according to Figure 28. \n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-03-18/ef87c0e3-acd6-46d4-bc33-443a4314ecab/0ec5d9e44972332bb36b50f6184ff06afc75aae7a5...",
        "content_length": 1506,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [
          "V2G2-199",
          "V2G2-200"
        ],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.5",
        "title": "PaymentServiceSelectionReq/Res",
        "content_preview": "",
        "content_length": 0,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
