        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.5.1",
        "title": "Payment and Service Selection Handling",
        "content_preview": "\nBased on the provided services and the corresponding payment options by the SECC this message pair allows the transmission of the selected PaymentOption, SelectedServices and related ParameterSets. Depending on the selected payment additional messages (PaymentDetails message pair) are exchanged. \n",
        "content_length": 299,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.5.2",
        "title": "PaymentServiceSelectionReq",
        "content_preview": "\nThis request message transports the information on the selected services and on how all the selected services are paid (see subclause 8.6.3.1). \n\n[V2G2-201] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in subclause 8.6.2, the EVCC and the SECC shall implement the mandatory messages and message elements as defined Table 104 and according to Figure 29. \n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-03-18/ef87c0e3-acd6-46d4-bc33-443a4314ecab/5ea24aea69fdf2da93f5302f87b77164a73459...",
        "content_length": 1339,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [
          "V2G2-202",
          "V2G2-201"
        ],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.5.3",
        "title": "PaymentServiceSelectionRes",
        "content_preview": "\nWith this message the SECC informs the EVCC whether the selected services and payment option were accepted. Depending on the selected payment additional messages (PaymentDetails message pair) are exchanged. \n\n[V2G2-203] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in subclause 8.6.2, the EVCC and the SECC shall implement the mandatory messages and message elements as defined in Table 104 and according to Figure 30. \n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-03-18/ef87c0e3-...",
        "content_length": 1128,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [
          "V2G2-203",
          "V2G2-204"
        ],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.6",
        "title": "PaymentDetailsReq/Res",
        "content_preview": "",
        "content_length": 0,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.6.1",
        "title": "PaymentDetailsReq/Res Handling",
        "content_preview": "\nThe payment details message pattern is only used when some particular payment details have to be exchanged (e.g. in case of contract based charging an eMAID would be necessary). \n",
        "content_length": 180,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.6.2",
        "title": "PaymentDetailsReq",
        "content_preview": "\nWith the PaymentDetailsReq the EVCC provides the payment details in case the selected payment was “Contract”. By sending the signature certificate chain and eMAID, the EVCC requests the SECC to send a challenge. \n\n[V2G2-205] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in subclause 8.6.2, the EVCC and the SECC shall implement the mandatory messages and message elements as defined Table 104 and according to Figure 31. \n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-03-18/ef87c0e...",
        "content_length": 1305,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [
          "V2G2-206",
          "V2G2-205"
        ],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [
          {
            "parameter": "th",
            "value": "14",
            "unit": "s",
            "type": "timer",
            "section": "8.4.3.6.2"
          },
          {
            "parameter": "th",
            "value": "15",
            "unit": "s",
            "type": "timer",
            "section": "8.4.3.6.2"
          },
          {
            "parameter": "th",
            "value": "14",
            "unit": "s",
            "type": "timer",
            "section": "8.4.3.6.2"
          },
          {
            "parameter": "th",
            "value": "15",
            "unit": "s",
            "type": "timer",
            "section": "8.4.3.6.2"
          }
        ],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.6.3",
        "title": "PaymentDetailsRes",
        "content_preview": "\nWith the PaymentDetailsRes the SECC informs the EVCC whether the previously provided payment details were accepted or not. The SECC sends also a challenge in the form of a random number, which has to be signed by the EVCC. \n\n[V2G2-208] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in subclause 8.6.2, the EVCC and the SECC shall implement the mandatory messages and message elements as defined in Table 104 and according to Figure 32. \n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026...",
        "content_length": 2843,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [
          "V2G2-899",
          "V2G2-209",
          "V2G2-208",
          "V2G2-826",
          "V2G2-898",
          "V2G2-825"
        ],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.7",
        "title": "AuthorizationReq/Res",
        "content_preview": "",
        "content_length": 0,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.7.1",
        "title": "AuthorizationReq",
        "content_preview": "\nIf a generated challenge was sent by the SECC in a previous message, the EVCC sends back this challenge and the respective signature. Otherwise, the message is empty. \n\n[V2G2-210] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in subclause 8.6.2, the EVCC and the SECC shall implement the mandatory messages and message elements as defined in Table 104 and according to Figure 33. \n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-03-18/ef87c0e3-acd6-46d4-bc33-443a4314ecab/7b3951c91cfa...",
        "content_length": 1488,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [
          "V2G2-210",
          "V2G2-698",
          "V2G2-697",
          "V2G2-211"
        ],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.7.2",
        "title": "AuthorizationRes",
        "content_preview": "\nFinally, the SECC verifies the challenge signature (and the certificate with its chain if not done before) and sends the corresponding authorization response message. \n\n[V2G2-212] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in subclause 8.6.2, the EVCC and the SECC shall implement the mandatory messages and message elements as defined in Table 104 and according to Figure 34. \n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-03-18/ef87c0e3-acd6-46d4-bc33-443a4314ecab/e59437605c8b...",
        "content_length": 2282,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [
          "V2G2-475",
          "V2G2-213",
          "V2G2-212",
          "V2G2-901",
          "V2G2-900"
        ],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.8",
        "title": "ChargeParameterDiscoveryReq/Res",
        "content_preview": "",
        "content_length": 0,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
