      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.9.1",
        "title": "PowerDeliveryReq/Res Handling",
        "content_preview": "\nThe Power Delivery message exchange marks the point in time when the EVSE provides voltage to its output power outlet and the EV can start to recharge its battery. \n\n[V2G2-286] The SAScheduleTupleID element shall identify the selected SAScheduleTuple element (see subclause 8.5.2.13) in the list of SAScheduleTuple elements (see subclause 8.5.2.12) provided in the ChargeParameterDiscoveryRes message (see subclause 8.4.3.8.3). \n",
        "content_length": 430,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
