          "V2G2-286"
        ],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.9.2",
        "title": "PowerDeliveryReq",
        "content_preview": "\nBy sending the PowerDeliveryReq the EVCC requests the SECC to provide power on and transmits the,`,`-` ChargingProfile the EVCC will follow during the charging process. \n\nNOTE 1 The point in time this message is sent does not necessarily correlate with the start of the charging process.```,, The EV may decide on the basis of its schedule when the charge process starts. \n\n[V2G2-221] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in subclause 8.6.2, the EVCC and the SECC shall implement the ...",
        "content_length": 2773,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [
          "V2G2-222",
          "V2G2-221"
