      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.10.1",
        "title": "CertificateUpdateReq/Res Handling",
        "content_preview": "\nUpdating the certificate of the EVCC is required when the certificate is still valid but is about to expire. In this use case the EVCC requests new certificate from the SECC to be installed into the EVCC. \n\n[V2G2-227] The EVCC shall request the required certificate at the SECC, provided the SECC offers this service as previously indicated in the element ServiceList in the message ,`--- ServiceDiscoveryRes. \n\nNOTE 1 If the SECC is not able to deliver the requested certificate an appropriate erro...",
        "content_length": 1118,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
