        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.10.2",
        "title": "CertificateUpdateReq",
        "content_preview": "\nBy sending the CertificateUpdateReq the vehicle requests the SECC to deliver new certificate that belongs to the currently valid contract of the vehicle. \n\n[V2G2-228] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in subclause 8.6.2, the EVCC and the SECC shall implement the mandatory messages and message elements as defined in Table 104 and according to Figure 39. \n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-03-18/ef87c0e3-acd6-46d4-bc33-443a4314ecab/aaf1c696d459f3be98e5503ff...",
        "content_length": 2591,
