      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.11.3",
        "title": "CertificateInstallationRes",
        "content_preview": "\nAfter receiving the CertificateInstallationReq from the EVCC, the SECC sends the CertificateInstallationRes including the requested certificate. Then the EVCC installs this certificate. \n\nThere is only one certificate delivered to the EVCC: the one for signing messages. It belongs to the currently valid contract of the EV. \n\n[V2G2-237] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in subclause 8.6.2, the EVCC and the SECC shall implement the mandatory messages and message elements as defi...",
        "content_length": 4433,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
