      {
        "section_number": "8.4.3.13.1",
        "title": "MeteringReceiptReq/Res Handling",
        "content_preview": "\nWhen sending a MeteringReceiptReq message the EVCC acknowledges that the data elements MeterInfo record, SessionID and the SAScheduleTupleID included in the ChargingStatusRes message prior to this request have been received from the SECC. This confirmation is implemented by applying a signature to the message body of the MeteringReceiptReq message. The signature applied by the EVCC is intended only to confirm that the EVCC, together with the currently applied charging contract certificate, whic...",
