        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.4.2.2",
        "title": "ChargingStatusReq",
        "content_preview": "\n[V2G2-242] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in subclause 8.6.2, the EVCC and the SECC shall implement the mandatory messages and message elements as defined in Table 104 and according to Figure 47. \n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-03-18/ef87c0e3-acd6-46d4-bc33-443a4314ecab/3e820abbaa5108d0a8fc17d0013f807c83920bd18087d2990bd65148cd57af7f.jpg)\n\n\n\nFigure 47 — Schema Diagram – ChargingStatusReq\n\n",
        "content_length": 440,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [
          "V2G2-242"
        ],
