      {
        "section_number": "8.4.5.2.1",
        "title": "CableCheckReq/Res Handling",
        "content_preview": "\nFor a safe DC charging a cable check shall be performed. \n",
        "content_length": 59,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.5.2.2",
        "title": "CableCheckReq",
        "content_preview": "\nThe CableCheckReq asks for the cable check status of the EVSE and e.g. tells the EVSE if the connector is locked on EV side and if the EV is ready to charge. \n\n[V2G2-249] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in subclause 8.6.2, the EVCC and the SECC shall implement the mandatory messages and message elements as defined in Table 104 and according to Figure 49. \n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-03-18/ef87c0e3-acd6-46d4-bc33-443a4314ecab/b14a650297f03c3beab37...",
        "content_length": 952,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [
          "V2G2-249",
          "V2G2-250"
        ],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "8.4.5.2.3",
        "title": "CableCheckRes",
        "content_preview": "\nAfter receiving the CableCheckReq from the EVCC the SECC sends the CableCheckRes informing the EVCC about result of cable check and EVSE status. \n\n[V2G2-251] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in subclause 8.6.2, the EVCC and the SECC shall implement the mandatory messages and message elements as defined in Table 104 and according to Figure 50. \n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-03-18/ef87c0e3-acd6-46d4-bc33-443a4314ecab/b224e1b27a11fc252c085b54befd24d667...",
        "content_length": 1842,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [
          "V2G2-251",
          "V2G2-252"
        ],
        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
