      {
        "section_number": "8.5.2.5",
        "title": "CertificateChainType",
        "content_preview": "\nThis data type stores the client certificate, and all certificates in the chain up to the root. The root certificate is not included in this data type. In the special (but unlikely) case, that a client certificate is directly signed by the root, the “SubCertificates” filed is empty. In all other cases, this field contains an ordered list of Sub-CAcertificates to follow the trust-path from the client certificate up to the root. \n\n[V2G2-274] Depending on the selected Message Set(s) as defined in ...",
