      {
        "section_number": "8.6.1",
        "title": "Overview",
        "content_preview": "\nPart 1 of this standard defines use case elements covering different charging scenarios. Depending on a use case and a charging scenario only a subset of the messages and parameters defined in this document have to be supported and transmitted by the EVCC and the SECC, respectively. \n\nThis chapter defines the mandatory and optional messages and parameter with respect to charging scenarios using External Identification Means (EIM) and charging scenarios using Plug and Charge (PnC) for identifica...",
