      {
        "section_number": "8.6.2.1",
        "title": "Overview",
        "content_preview": "\nThe EV manufacturer and the EVSE manufacturer can choose to support either one or multiple Message Sets as shown in Figure 96. Table 104 defines all mandatory parts of the message sets as shown in Figure 96. \n\nFor the EVCC the following applies in general: \n\n[V2G2-659] An EVCC shall support a message or parameter in a Message Set if it is marked with an \"M\" for the EVCC. \n\n[V2G2-660] If not defined differently by requirements, an EVCC may support a parameter in a Message Set if it is marked wit...",
        "content_length": 50343,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "general",
        "test_importance": "high",
