      {
        "section_number": "8.6.3.1",
        "title": "Message Sets for AC/DC Charging EIM/PnC",
        "content_preview": "\nThe selection of the Message Set is based on the selected payment option in the PaymentServiceSelectionReq message. \n\nFigure 97 shows an overview for selecting the Messages Sets “AC Charging EIM”, “DC Charging EIM”, AC Charging PnC”, and “DC Charging PnC” based on the definitions for PaymentServiceSelectionReq (refer to subclause 8.4.3.5.2) and ChargeParameterDiscoveryReq (refer to subclause 8.4.3.8.2). \n\n![image](https://cdn-mineru.openxlab.org.cn/result/2026-03-18/ef87c0e3-acd6-46d4-bc33-443a...",
        "content_length": 2047,
        "level": 1,
