        "content_preview": "\n[V2G2-714] The SECC shall set the timeout V2G_SECC_CommunicationSetup_Performance_Time to the value as defined in Table 110, reset the V2G_SECC_CommunicationSetup_Timer and start monitoring the V2G_SECC_CommunicationSetup_Timer when a successful Data-Link establishment is indicated (D-LINK_READY.indication(DLINKSTATUS=Link established). \n\n[V2G2-715] The SECC shall wait for the SessionSetupReq message. \n\n[V2G2-716] The SECC shall stop waiting for SessionSetupReq and stop monitoring the V2G_SECC_...",
