      {
        "section_number": "8.7.3.4",
        "title": "EVCC Timing for EVSEProcessing parameter",
        "content_preview": "\n[V2G2-710] If the EVCC receives a V2G response message with parameter EVSEProcessing equal to 'Ongoing' for the first time in a response message it shall start the timer V2G_EVCC_Ongoing_Timer and wait for parameter EVSEProcessing equal to 'Finished'. \n\n[V2G2-711] If [V2G2-710] applies, the EVCC shall stop the V2G Communication Session when V2G_EVCC_Ongoing_Timer is equal or larger than V2G_EVCC_Ongoing_Timeout and no parameter EVSEProcessing equal to 'Finished' has been received. \n",
        "content_length": 488,
        "level": 1,
        "classification": "functional",
        "test_importance": "high",
        "requirements": [
          "V2G2-711",
