        "content_preview": "\n[V2G2-704] The EVCC shall set the timeout V2G_EVCC_PreCharge_Timeout to the value as defined in Table 111, reset the V2G_EVCC_PreCharge_Timer and start monitoring the V2G_EVCC_PreCharge_Timer when sending the message PreChargeReq for the first time in a charging session. \n\nNOTE In this document, sending a request message is described by A-Data.request. \n\n[V2G2-705] The EVCC shall wait for the Pre Charging to finish, indicated by the EV determining that the EVSE output voltage, as measured insid...",
