        "content_preview": "\nPart 1. Table A. 1 gives a detailed overview on the Message Sets as defined in subclause 8.6, and the covered Use Case Elements A1 – H1 as defined in Part 1. The Identification Modes External Identification Means (EIM) and the Identification Mode Plug and Charge (PnC) cover various Use Cases elements as defined in \n\n\nTable A. 1 — Message Set(s) and covered use case elements\n\n\n<table><tr><td></td><td></td><td>AC Chargin EIM</td><td>DC Chargin EIM</td><td>AC Chargin PnC</td><td>DC Chargin PnC</td...",
