        "is_message_def": false,
        "message_type": null,
        "fields": [],
        "timing_params": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "section_number": "",
        "title": "E.4 Security appliances and their associated certificates",
        "content_preview": "\nThis subclause provides an overview over the different security use cases. \n\n\nTable E.1 — Security use cases and their associated certificates\n\n\n<table><tr><td colspan=\"2\"></td><td colspan=\"3\">Relevant Credentials</td></tr><tr><td>Security Appliances</td><td>Comment</td><td>EVCC (EV)</td><td>SECC (EVSE)</td><td>Secondary Actor</td></tr><tr><td>Simplified Certificate management in Private EnvironmentPlease refer to Annex E.2</td><td>DC/AC Charging with simplified key managementTLS Authentication...",
